1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,911
Yang masuk, dapat makan.

2
00:00:01,989 --> 00:00:03,052
Tapi harus kerja.

3
00:00:03,591 --> 00:00:06,556
Xu Yan, kau gila!

4
00:00:06,637 --> 00:00:08,608
Mereka habiskan beras,

5
00:00:08,686 --> 00:00:11,108
kalian yang kelaparan!

6
00:00:11,179 --> 00:00:12,559
Beras cuma cukup dua bulan.

7
00:00:12,944 --> 00:00:14,991
Dua bulan, gali satu saluran.

8
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:17,514
Satu cangkul, satu mangkuk.

9
00:00:21,969 --> 00:00:23,215
Lebih dalam lagi!

10
00:00:23,288 --> 00:00:24,726
Sepuluh kaki, semangkuk.

11
00:00:24,813 --> 00:00:26,086
Nama, sebut ke dia.

12
00:00:26,325 --> 00:00:27,164
Berikutnya!

13
00:00:29,925 --> 00:00:31,505
Sepatunya baru.

14
00:00:31,904 --> 00:00:33,709
Tangannya kapalan.

15
00:00:33,789 --> 00:00:34,982
Mereka bertanya—

16
00:00:35,056 --> 00:00:37,669
di mana perempuan pendiam itu tinggal.

17
00:00:37,745 --> 00:00:38,517
Awasi mereka.

18
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,395
Diam-diam saja.

19
00:00:39,459 --> 00:00:41,467
Sekarung pun nggak laku?

20
00:00:41,547 --> 00:00:42,539
Semalam,

21
00:00:42,607 --> 00:00:44,531
anjlok setengah!

22
00:00:44,614 --> 00:00:46,717
Xu Yan—!

23
00:00:47,186 --> 00:00:47,962
Daftar namanya?

24
00:00:48,016 --> 00:00:49,324
Buat jatah beras besok.

25
00:00:51,437 --> 00:00:52,579
Tulisan ini…

26
00:00:52,655 --> 00:00:54,592
Rapi kayak surat istana.

27
00:00:54,660 --> 00:00:55,792
Cuma tulisan.

28
00:00:55,860 --> 00:00:56,632
Tulisan bagus.

29
00:00:56,910 --> 00:00:57,682
Nggak tanya.

30
00:00:57,820 --> 00:01:00,889
Padat karya: berhasil.

31
00:01:02,937 --> 00:01:04,010
Tiga.

32
00:01:04,165 --> 00:01:05,097
Genderang?

33
00:01:05,365 --> 00:01:06,933
Di gunung.

34
00:01:08,965 --> 00:01:10,094
Perampok.

35
00:01:10,165 --> 00:01:10,985
Laki-laki,

36
00:01:11,055 --> 00:01:12,266
cuma puluhan.

37
00:01:12,594 --> 00:01:13,534
Ratusan obor…

38
00:01:14,321 --> 00:01:14,795
Tutup gerbang.
